  <item>
    <title>Vol.132总说在西安“馍可夹万物”，是有什么说法吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b7fabbcaaea1fb3b96295d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b7fabbcaaea1fb3b96295d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Mar 2026 12:48:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊“馍可夹万物”，在西安的具像化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">02:53</a>刚刚举办的菜夹馍大赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a>夹馍一时爽，吃时毁断肠——那，吃不了，就兜着走吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a>菜夹馍的报菜名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a>吃夹馍的时间表</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1401">23:21</a>6辣子夹馍怎么能少呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1693">28:13</a>香的很</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a>从擀面皮到炒凉粉，有啥不能夹进馍里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a>馍有大不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2394">39:54</a>欢迎在吃夹馍这件事上见多识广的大家，补充下你吃过的，我们没提到的夹馍种类，让我们也涨涨见识</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结尾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：Remember Where You Are—Jessie Ware</span></p><span></span><p><span>【欢迎加入听友群，入群+v：xiaohuli4946】</span></p>]]></description>
