  <item>
    <title>Vol.131《流俗地》读后有感：生活嘛，好像也没什么大不了的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a9821cc8cdeb38c2f9e379</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a9821cc8cdeb38c2f9e379</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Mar 2026 13:22:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>即使有，随着时间推移，好像，也没关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊《流俗地》这本小说。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>可以随时进入故事，也可以随时抽离出来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a>形影不离的儿时伙伴——三</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">09:39</a>一个与结尾八杆子打不着的开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a>颇具意味的“楼上楼”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a>谁是小说名称“流”和“俗”的代表人物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">20:38</a>“银霞银霞，迦尼萨断掉了哪一根象牙？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">27:54</a>谁睁着眼睛，却看不见？谁是盲人，却能处处感知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a>“难得木讷是君子，难得静默是良人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a>有些事情本就没道理，没原由，所以也就没必要较劲，更不知道跟谁较劲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a>一些“小时候不懂，长大了慢慢便懂了”的道理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2464">41:04</a>总有一些声音，能把我们再次拉回到以往</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2686">44:46</a>看这本书的我们，可能回忆深处都有一个自己没察觉到的“流俗地”</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结尾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：陈粒—自渡</span></p><span></span><p><span>【欢迎加入听友群，入群+V:xiaohuli4946】</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6389ab0feb2670cebe659f0c/lkXnPbiPDwLgu-Tfuy28hqE_cKEI.m4a" length="46797365" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWLAovbBo3hWdsw9EvHxlZEkJcd.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.130在新年里，用老歌怀旧·什么时候开始，我们不太听新歌了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699714bcde29766da9f1564f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699714bcde29766da9f1564f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Feb 2026 13:56:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新春快乐！喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊那些年，那些歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>【在新年这特殊节点，许多怀旧的物件、往日的画面，仿佛就会重新出现在脑海，而我们，想通过这期，跟大家用音乐开启，新的一年怀旧的旅程】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">04:41</a>什么时候开始，我们的歌单里越来越少出现新歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a>童年里的“最强音符”，老房子，和午后阳光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a>是谁，在超慢跑歌单里听到了千禧年的兔子舞，还是忍不住跟着left right</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a>春晚上刚唱过的《踏浪》，距今已经26年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">26:37</a>一样的动作，一样的青春，在教室里戴着耳机偷偷听歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1903">31:43</a>电脑下载——转存到内存——插入mp3，天呐那会听歌那么复杂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">40:32</a>一些老歌，一些旧友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2826">47:06</a>喜欢哪种曲风，拥有哪种心境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3427">57:07</a>是什么，让2019年出生的小孩，喜欢听2006年发行的歌曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3741">1:02:21</a>老歌带给人的治愈感，是非常独特的</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是，你们那首单曲循环的歌，是哪一首呢？又有着怎样的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：SHE-热带雨林</span></p><span></span><p><span>【欢迎加入听友群，入群+V:xiaohuli4946】</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6389ab0feb2670cebe659f0c/lidgH5oZ1l7j60b4EZ15UkIgh-sF.m4a" length="65673941" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq1QArtHlEt5vCtUu9PwHOR4auqT.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.129这一年里，那些闪光的“喝杯咖啡的时间”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698b33b4a22480add68a7d8c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698b33b4a22480add68a7d8c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 13:37:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊“喝杯咖啡的时间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a>闪光的，是一些真挚的夸夸（在此再次谢谢所有表达支持的你们，时间有限，不然就全都年出来了【骄傲脸】）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a>咖啡庄园初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a>一年前，喝咖啡的锚点是三顿半vs一年后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a>咖啡馆的调性，不应该只通过包装咖啡馆主理人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a>小提示：【一般情况下】如何辨识一家咖啡馆是否适合进去消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a>喝杯咖啡的，社交距离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a>人民咖啡馆？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a>一个人+一个人+一个人凑出来的，三个人的“喝杯咖啡的时间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2004">33:24</a>台风过境后去喝巴浪鱼咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a>下雨天骑着电驴去没门儿咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a>关于喝杯咖啡的时间，一个小小的邀请</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结尾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：The Marias - Heavy</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6389ab0feb2670cebe659f0c/lsfaAB1e4kNyzgXT5CJPsnGGr5Lv.m4a" length="43099131" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWLAovbBo3hWdsw9EvHxlZEkJcd.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.128出国也就那样？VS出国还能那样！当我们谈论留学的真实价值</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698353d1824dce367c65b0c1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698353d1824dce367c65b0c1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Feb 2026 14:22:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊退下滤镜的留学生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a>最近频繁刷到海外留子的“真实生活”vlog，怎么跟之前画风大不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a>自制美食，还是凑活维持生命体征餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a>留学生活，落脚点是留学，还是生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a>再搞抽象，还是得努力学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a>异国他乡，会放大很多“又一次”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a>那确实是一面，但那只是一面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a>撕下滤镜，民间“清朗”——up主“正经的老邪”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1419">23:39</a>海外留子博主起号路径一览</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a>《时差一万公里》的留学前后生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1996">33:16</a>留学生回国，重新进行各种适应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a>贴脸开大：留学投入产出比，值吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2514">41:54</a>时间维度拉大一点，谁没出过国似的（此处是一个自娱自乐的玩笑）</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结尾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：BLACKPINK-Stay</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>【欢迎加入听友群：入群+V——xiaohuli4946】</span></blockquote>]]></description>
