  <item>
    <title>Vol.127马年特辑·名动海内外的西安文物“马”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6975ca4d109824f9e16a0341</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6975ca4d109824f9e16a0341</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Jan 2026 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊西安那些“文物马”，为即将到来的马年助助兴。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a>是谁，自诩“爱马士”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a>原是也想聊陕西出土的文物——西周蠡驹尊，但是吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a>是谁，这几年还会上假兵马俑的当</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a>一则“老陕落入美丽国陷阱”的搞笑旧闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a>是谁，想把自家埃及法老猫带去东方金字塔——茂陵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a>它，既是胜利的纪念碑，又是灭亡的陪葬品</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/686a7a0b93fd2d72b8cc6dfa" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/686a7a0b93fd2d72b8cc6dfa"><span>云逛碑林博物馆新馆，看昭陵六骏石刻</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>集名画、名刻、名诗、名书于一体的艺术瑰宝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a>从马球图，到舞马壶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2189">36:29</a>是谁，还在怀念之前看过的西安博物院特展《长安有故里》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/64928eaea5b2b405c663e024" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/64928eaea5b2b405c663e024"><span>云逛《长安有故里》，西安博物院诚不我欺</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2359">39:19</a>怎样一幅画马图，让历代藏家“弹幕”不停歇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a>怕新年来临时鞭炮声太响，提前再提前，送上我们的新年祝福</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结束-</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：陶喆-苏三说</span></p><span></span><p><span>【欢迎加入听友群，入群+V:xiaohuli4946】</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6389ab0feb2670cebe659f0c/ls_xw4CaW_nlSqNrAnoj3FuEidKH.m4a" length="44931346" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWLAovbBo3hWdsw9EvHxlZEkJcd.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.126聊聊仪式感里的真感情——重点不是“仪式”，而是？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696df585ef1cf272a738de30</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696df585ef1cf272a738de30</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Jan 2026 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，让我们在农历新年即将来临之际，聊聊“仪式感”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a>跨了元旦这个年，接下来，就要守农历新年这个岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a>谁是那个很有仪式感的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a>营造属于自己的仪式感，给自己的纪念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a>婚礼，对许多新人来说像是一场仪式感大考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a>一些具有女性特质的情绪，会在婚礼上游走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a>出片约等于有仪式感的来过？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">31:19</a>可能比出片更重要的，是那一刻时的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a>无处安放的跨年夜，究竟要怎么跨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a>不知道该买什么的旅游伴手礼，这该死的仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2438">40:38</a>爱的五种语言：优质的陪伴+行动上的服务+礼物的象征+肯定的言词+身体的触碰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2528">42:08</a>仪式感的落脚点，在“感”，感情，感恩，感谢，不在鼓励消费</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结尾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：4 Seasons - XG</span></p><span></span><p><span>【欢迎加入听友群，入群+V:xiaohuli4946</span></p>]]></description>
