    <guid isPermaLink="false">69649087f8b05f9f751e467a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Jan 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊这场“云游”——滇西之行+一场婚礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a>去有风的地方，万万没想到，这风也太大了吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a>等待洱海边的一场日出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a>如果说旅拍摄影师是来打猎的，那我们是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a>洱海边的下午茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a>在保山的咖啡庄园里采摘咖啡豆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a>高黎贡山的徒步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a>荒野厨房的就餐体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">27:35</a>勇敢的人，先知道牛瘪是什么滋味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a>芒市不容错过——丙午街集市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2169">36:09</a>听，这是傍晚时分芒市半山腰间的声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2358">39:18</a>此行原本以及最终的目的：为了参加一场朋友的婚礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a>时间紧任务重的昆明一日游全线</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结尾-</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>结尾曲：乐乐还未发布的，听友先听的，一首新歌《唤》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>欢迎加入听友群,入群+V——xiaohuli4946</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq_vZniD5GCQAv4kVKis3vdKpnOC.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkQb1aXDzBT4sz_BZJ3DvBCrE0tH.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
