  <item>
    <title>Vol.124喝杯咖啡的时间，爱你老几，明天见，明年见</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694feeba2db086f897468200</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694feeba2db086f897468200</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Dec 2025 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊“爱你老几”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a>当我在一些咖啡馆主理人的微信朋友圈看到“爱你老几”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a>有人即使一人食，也会对自己奢宠有加；有人却一直在跟食物较劲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">08:51</a>有人，跟时间和每一天的安排较劲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a>聊天记录里的高频美好词汇：不急，不着急</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a>是什么，让J人想要P一些；又是什么，让P人不自觉很J</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a>怎么一提到“爱你老几”，就会强调是“东亚”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a>都是东亚小孩，我们确实会在爱自己时觉得自己“自私”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1869">31:09</a>说到爱你老几，就不得不说老陕们的comfort food</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a>如何复刻一晚老陕的家常版油泼面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a>说到爱你老几，就不得不说喝杯咖啡的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2572">42:52</a>打个小申请</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，提前祝大家，2026新年快乐，希望在新的一年里，喝杯咖啡的时间，继续与你们相伴！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>-结尾-</span></h2><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：Beautiful-Crush</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>【欢迎加入听友群，入群+V：xiaohuli4946】</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>说到做到，万一有听友真的好奇——家常版油泼面我的做法⬇️（有手就会）</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.面条是我在买的便利店预制面条；</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.调料很简单：葱花+生抽（多）+醋（少）+秦椒（记得一定得是秦椒辣椒面哈，香而不辣）+盐（一点）+花椒粉（适量）；</span></p><span></span><p><span>😊以上无刻度的配料表，见笑了</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.最关键的一步：烧到冒烟的热油，浇在这个面碗上，一瞬间香气四溢，搅拌开吃即可。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrDfPLCntLBYZiYbGSXRMvtC8Ebl.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>油泼辣子辣面推荐⬇️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmKWuEXUdFsjHVc3Ad0_SQIUNQ2P.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsB-Ftcxf53s7Abk5-7Q_SMSN2Op.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
