  <item>
    <title>Vol.123无业游民如何看待“把人生当答题卡”的优等考生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6948d4670b60b7bf75c488b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6948d4670b60b7bf75c488b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Dec 2025 05:28:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊一聊，如果把人生当成答题卡，的一点小思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a>2025年末的这个节点啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a>从“上岸”到“交代”，一代人有一代人对正确答案的传承</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a>20多岁令人一度艳羡的强规划感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a>20岁vs30岁vs50岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a>生活不过是甘苦自知罢了，没必要羡慕他人，没必要自怨自艾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a>为什么有些人，喜欢找一些参考答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1972">32:52</a>步调不一致，就有可能“被优化掉？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2352">39:12</a>有些困惑和迷茫，或许是“只缘身在此山中”呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a>老话说十年磨一剑，我俩感慨：2年打一个小小的结</span></p><span></span><p><span>提早在这里，祝各位2026山重水复疑无路，柳暗花明又一村！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结尾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：Pet Shop Boys - Go West</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>【欢迎加入听友群，入群+v：xiaohuli4946】</span></blockquote>]]></description>
