  <item>
    <title>Vol.122城市漫谈：老陕们口中的日韩干，是不是一种松弛感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693f8fc037f52a644efd0d54</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">693f8fc037f52a644efd0d54</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Dec 2025 04:38:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊最近的陕西流行词——日韩干</span></p><span></span><p><span>ps：本期内任何听起来略带调侃的内容，都也针对我们自己，毕竟我俩，是陕派日韩干大军中的资深成员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a>到底经历了什么，使得这期咖啡时间里没有喝到咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a>日韩干拆字解读——日子闲的没事干的时候会干的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a>好好的地方话，怎么就让人有点破防</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a>是从户县锅巴开始流行起来的吧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a>从挖野菜到捡木瓜，哪样也不能落下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">18:27</a>是谁，一边日韩干一边急哄哄，是我们自己呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1526">25:26</a>都不着急挣钱嘛？这么多人日韩干</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1913">31:53</a>“你这东西，出个价卖给我”“不卖不卖，这我要自己留着”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a>不排除，是有那么一小撮儿·真时间管理大师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a>“批量生产？卖货？”“不弄不弄，那就不好玩了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a>是哪种价值，又是哪种价值的衡量标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2459">40:59</a>预约明年挖野菜，有一起的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结尾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：SZA, Justin Timberlake - The Other Side</span></p><span></span><p><span>【欢迎加入听友群，入群+v：xiaohuli4946】</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6389ab0feb2670cebe659f0c/lhuv8rZpwFY_X04ho-gfril9MOul.m4a" length="42982332" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWLAovbBo3hWdsw9EvHxlZEkJcd.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
