    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊观剧体验《唐朝诡事录之长安》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a>一听有人问酥山，就对上号了：诡友你好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a>城南韦杜，10块钱走不？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">07:14</a>大明宫的视野</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a>六合酥山店开在兴庆公园附近？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a>谁在渭城驿写出了“渭城朝雨邑轻尘”来着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a>是qu（一声）还是qu（三声）的曲江</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1594">26:34</a>千年万岁，椒花颂声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1883">31:23</a>士vs商</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a>从唐朝诡事录之长安里的小颜真卿，联想到西安碑林博物馆里的颜氏家庙碑，士族如何，庶族又如何？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2359">39:19</a>通过追剧，对唐108坊都多了些认识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a>生活在西安，历史不枯燥</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结尾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：WINTER WITHOUT YOU -Orchestra ver.- (Instrumental)</span></p><span></span><p><span>【欢迎加入听友群，入群+v：xiaohuli4946】</span></p>]]></description>
