    <title>Vol.118浪走citywalk·大隐隐于西安闹市的猫猫寺——大兴善寺</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690f4b07af4fc00da7c288ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690f4b07af4fc00da7c288ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Nov 2025 13:55:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝杯咖啡的时间，听我俩聊聊西安大兴善寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a>大兴善寺初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a>都市传说——道听途说的那些大兴善寺神奇事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a>到底是大·兴善寺，还是大兴·善寺，还是大兴善·寺？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a>大兴善里一道靓丽的风景线——猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1534">25:34</a>纳猫契，竟然真是老祖宗们玩剩的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1916">31:56</a>大兴善寺秋季的彼岸花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2217">36:57</a>冬季的雪中腊梅图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a>不只是免费猫咖，更是这座城市里不可多得的“时空胶囊”</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，慢下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2739">45:39</a>善于发现生活中的美</span></p><span></span><p><span>-结尾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾曲：Ariana Grande-Twilight Zone</span></p><span></span><p><span>【欢迎加入听友群：入群+v——xiaohuli4946】</span></p>]]></description>
